[{"type":"message","user":"USLACKBOT","text":"Reminder: vimrc読書会はじまるのでは \u003chttps://gitter.im/vim-jp/reading-vimrc\u003e","ts":"1628344216.042700","attachments":[{"fallback":"vim-jp/reading-vimrc","id":1,"title":"vim-jp/reading-vimrc","title_link":"https://gitter.im/vim-jp/reading-vimrc","text":"vimrc読書会 \u003chttp://vim-jp.org/reading-vimrc/\u003e","thumb_url":"https://avatars-02.gitter.im/group/iv/4/57542c13c43b8c601976faa9","blocks":null,"service_name":"gitter.im","service_icon":"http://cdn03.gitter.im/_s/1b6fe6ccd/images/favicon-normal.ico","thumb_width":128,"thumb_height":128,"from_url":"https://gitter.im/vim-jp/reading-vimrc","original_url":"https://gitter.im/vim-jp/reading-vimrc"}],"edited":{"user":"B01","ts":"1628344217.000000"},"bot_id":"B01","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"ed688a8b-3d62-4ee3-bb67-bddbc32f178f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"typoしてた。恥ずかしっ。","ts":"1628323771.042400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3INeV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2a83ed3-9654-4464-9c34-f5125664ced6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あ、真面目な mhatta さんだ。","ts":"1628315572.040400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0wPqd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"094cdf34-9f9f-4986-80dc-98291fb770ff","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Redditね","ts":"1628315410.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Q3o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e2cdbb2-b956-439b-b2ed-7fcc0324c1fc","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"いや、正しくは「Radditで上がってた質問を自サイトで答えた」と言ったほうがいいのかな。","ts":"1628314894.038800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4GF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f500e928-6792-4d8b-ae63-536ac3b8f435","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今原文を読んだけど、確かになぜ使ってるのか、もっと効率的にできないかを自問自答するのは大事ですね","ts":"1628314887.038600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5YGH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d3862d1-feb4-4d46-85a5-fd7c4a9e06a4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1628314852.037300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FbpCF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab876dd1-c918-4789-9324-fef7f1ebd42f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"これRadditでやり取りされた文章の転載なんですわ。","ts":"1628314738.037100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1kl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00942E30-00EC-4BCE-9531-6154C909452A","type":"message","user":"U7ZUUQSBT","text":"ほうほう","ts":"1628314731.036900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sap9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d4948f8-c764-4a1d-9a61-c6b9f9a5f088","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"作者にコンタクトとれないんですか?","ts":"1628314682.036400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aq+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70b53004-6af1-4ba8-9693-3933dc94598f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"これ学習曲線でいう「何も分からない」状態になった時に、一つの解として読んだ方がいい重要な文章だと思うのですがCCライセンスじゃないから翻訳できない…。","ts":"1628314651.036100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pIi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c59b871d-87e9-4d64-9200-a5b6644669e0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まぁその記事の著者はそう思ったんだなと感じるだけですねぇ","ts":"1628314619.035100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G6k/S"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02AHDRU25R","text":"\u003c@U02AHDRU25R\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628314023.033200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"685db3f6-59db-474c-ae7f-54e3a5116b22","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"元記事にもそういう風な記載がありますね。","ts":"1628313654.032800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K5rqg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efa17eac-3f08-40f4-a36d-a4ef4d6dcf85","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"そして定期的な使用ツールの見直しは本当大事だと思う。いつの間にか時代に置いて行かれてないようにしないといけない本当に。","ts":"1628313639.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PQs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98b57177-1d68-4aea-a89d-7f95b2a99d31","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"自分の場合だとVimとterminal側のツールを連携させる為にterminalとかOS側の知識を勉強することになって\nそこで得た知識がその後仕事でかなり役立ってるので、無駄と思ったことは無いなあ。\nVimという大好きなツールの為なので勉強が苦にならなかった","ts":"1628313485.030400","edited":{"user":"U01J7703PFT","ts":"1628313508.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dXNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fefc2925-f7f2-432e-ab63-8c55252d9599","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"でも、定期的に本当にこのツールは学ぶべき価値があるのか? と自問自答するのはいいことだと思いますね。競合を知るのも大事だし、自分自身のロードマップを考えるのもの大事。あまり盲目になり過ぎるのは結構危いと思う。","ts":"1628313467.030000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U01J7703PFT","UL6CFN8NR","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h/LLZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf09759-a4b8-4b3b-a3ea-6e40a9d3205d","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕は一度 Atom に全振りしたことがあるので、どのエディタで何ができるのか、何が得意なのかわかったつもりなので、いまはEmacsを使っているけど、ロックインはされていないつもりだったりします。","ts":"1628313208.026700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kyj7L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61ec4ec4-8b69-4658-aed9-d53657f9f716","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"文章がちぐはぐになって少し読みにくくなりますが、Google翻訳を使って読んでみる価値はあるかと思います。","ts":"1628313205.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y7j3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8e71225-cab7-4770-838f-43de6054077d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"テキストエディタで一生遊べるドン！何か問題でも？","ts":"1628313189.026000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TY5Kg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f002b60b-9875-4517-8353-83bbf2bc2fb2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"オッ、それは私に対する台詞かな？","ts":"1628313157.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G6bL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96afda06-d0df-4b41-bbdb-fe4972b4eaf3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"楽しいじゃん、それでいい","ts":"1628313132.023600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":4,"users":["U81LLJ340","U7ZUUQSBT","U7CJ2P52B","U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t9wL7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1ba2bb0-f15f-4832-935a-25a696d99721","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"自分の意訳ですが「8年ほどEmacsを使って色んな機能（電子メール、RSS、ブラウジング、電卓などを含む）を勉強したり設定を突き詰めたりしたけど、そもそも学習に費やした時間が無駄だったんじゃないか？終わりのないプロセスにこれ以上の時間的投資を続ける必要があるのか分からない」という感じかと。","ts":"1628312996.023300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aq1kG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14b6ac80-a0af-48a3-b1e9-993fdd43d9a5","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"\u003c@UFHQ7TNT0\u003e さん案件かもしれないけど、これVimにでも言えるんじゃないですかね（議題に上がっているのはEmacsです）\n\u003chttps://karl-voit.at/2021/07/23/emacs-lock-in/\u003e","ts":"1628312735.022300","attachments":[{"fallback":"public voit - Web-page of Karl Voit: The Emacs Lock-In Effect or the Emacs Sunk Cost Fallacy","id":1,"title":"The Emacs Lock-In Effect or the Emacs Sunk Cost Fallacy","title_link":"https://karl-voit.at/2021/07/23/emacs-lock-in/","text":"The Emacs Lock-In Effect or the Emacs Sunk Cost Fallacy","thumb_url":"http://Karl-Voit.at/images/public-voit_T_logo_200x200.png","blocks":null,"ts":1627044480,"service_name":"public voit - Web-page of Karl Voit","service_icon":"https://karl-voit.at/favicon.ico","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://karl-voit.at/2021/07/23/emacs-lock-in/","original_url":"https://karl-voit.at/2021/07/23/emacs-lock-in/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hmrDK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e114c7e9-1a6e-4fca-a44d-08cbdff7923e","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"東京ですらこんな企画出しているんだから別にダジャレじゃないし（白目）\n\u003chttps://prkita.jp/kitakumeshi/\u003e","ts":"1628299207.021100","attachments":[{"fallback":"#東京都北区帰宅メシ | PR Station / 一般社団法人東京北区観光協会","id":1,"title":"#東京都北区帰宅メシ | PR Station / 一般社団法人東京北区観光協会","title_link":"https://prkita.jp/kitakumeshi/","text":"東京都北区でお持ち帰りできる飲食店のメシ繋がりプロジェクト！北区の「おいしい」を自宅に持ち帰ろう！","blocks":null,"service_name":"prkita.jp","from_url":"https://prkita.jp/kitakumeshi/","original_url":"https://prkita.jp/kitakumeshi/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Axt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bf7def1-5673-4ef9-8495-ba49218b9946","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"他の区の人「北区難民」","ts":"1628299120.020300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f=N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7191d35a-a25b-4472-97b4-4d7259d29ed7","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"その代わり、北区に住んだら「北区で生きたくない」がホラ吹き扱いされるというリスクが","ts":"1628298061.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":4,"users":["U022PB40WAF","U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iua"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4629d305-32c9-4523-a3c6-64d697235d76","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"親父ギャグとして後輩に白い目で見られる事はなくなるので:yoshi:"